{"id":"f4b11a58eb0068b4","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-glb-fixed-point.md","title":"Bimodal Fixed Point Theorem","display":"thm-glb-fixed-point — Bimodal Fixed Point Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-glb-fixed-point","aliases":["89-thm-glb-fixed-point"],"display":"thm-glb-fixed-point — Bimodal Fixed Point Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","[[89-df-glb-logic]]","[[89-df-dotted-box]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-glb-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-glb-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-glb-fixed-point — Bimodal Fixed Point Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6d483dd2c6fd176\" href=\"?note=a6d483dd2c6fd176\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-formula\">89-df-bimodal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95a48b6ae42f7e48\" href=\"?note=95a48b6ae42f7e48\" title=\"89-df-dotted-box\">89-df-dotted-box</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}_B(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}_B(A,p)\\)</span>；该谓词及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0^+\">\\(\\Box_0^+\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6d483dd2c6fd176\" href=\"?note=a6d483dd2c6fd176\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-formula\">89-df-bimodal-formula</a> 的结构递归定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_B\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_B\\)</span> 为双模态公式树的字母集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+_0B=B\\land\\Box_0B\">\\(\\Box^+_0B=B\\land\\Box_0B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=H]\">\\(A[p:=H]\\)</span> 是双模态结构替换。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\)</span> 是双模态定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+_0\">\\(\\Box^+_0\\)</span> 仅是显示缩写。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Var}_B(H)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_B(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\n\\land\n(\\Box^+_0(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Box^+_0(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\n\\land(H\\leftrightarrow A[p:=H])\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Var}_B(H)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_B(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\n\\land\n(\\Box^+_0(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Box^+_0(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\n\\land(H\\leftrightarrow A[p:=H])\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章，印刷页 208–212；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\nIgnatiev 定理。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 仅用一种盒，可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 也仅用该盒。原书通过辅助系统的有限特征类型与加权子公式计数证明；这不是只由两种盒各自满足 Löb 公理即可省略交互步骤的结论。定理引用原书证明，未在此展开辅助系统的全部有限特征构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bimodal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-box]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bimodal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}$，$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$，$\\mathrm{Modalized}_B(A,p)$；该谓词及 $\\Box_0^+$ 取 [[89-df-bimodal-formula]] 的结构递归定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}_B(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+_0B=B\\land\\Box_0B","display":false},{"tex":"A[p:=H]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Var}_B(H)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_B(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\n\\land\n(\\Box^+_0(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Box^+_0(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\n\\land(H\\leftrightarrow A[p:=H])\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":1576,"backlinks":[{"id":"d773e54334af93ea","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-glb-fixed-point]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-formula]] → [[89-thm-glb-fixed-point]]：以结构递归的双模态模态化谓词表达原先的盒作用域条件。"}],"outgoing":["a6d483dd2c6fd176","5a9efa2261b8f73c","95a48b6ae42f7e48"]}